 An overall 7.0 does not automatically satisfy a requirement of no section below 6.5 if one component is 6.0."}],["$","p","Record the exact university, degree, intake, overall requirement and component minimum. Scholarship and admission language conditions can be separate, and immigration evidence may involve another check.",{"children":"Record the exact university, degree, intake, overall requirement and component minimum. Scholarship and admission language conditions can be separate, and immigration evidence may involve another check."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$L1f","$undefined","$undefined"]}],"$L20","$L21","$L22"]}],false,"$L23","$L24"]}],false]}]
